# 根目录仅作为网页镜像构建上下文，只发送前端源码和 Nginx 配置。
**
!Hub-vue/
!Hub-vue/package.json
!Hub-vue/package-lock.json
!Hub-vue/index.html
!Hub-vue/tsconfig*.json
!Hub-vue/vite.config.mts
!Hub-vue/eslint.config.mts
!Hub-vue/src/
!Hub-vue/src/**
!Hub-vue/public/
!Hub-vue/public/**
!Hub-vue/scripts/
!Hub-vue/scripts/**
!Hub-vue/tests/
!Hub-vue/tests/**
!deploy/
!deploy/nginx/
!deploy/nginx/Dockerfile
!deploy/nginx/default.conf

# 环境配置和本机数据不进入构建上下文。
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
